eam/apps/2062910/extras/b78e4886268196176c0d8da7bf1b6fdf.poster.avif?t=1688876621\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2062910/extras/b78e4886268196176c0d8da7bf1b6fdf.webm?t=1688876621\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2062910/extras/b78e4886268196176c0d8da7bf1b6fdf.mp4?t=1688876621\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Take on the challenge</strong></h2>The game is easy to pick up, but should pose a challenge for everyone. You will have to communicate, divide jobs and also strategize! Different enemies and maps require different strategies - what worked on one map may not work on another.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2062910/extras/4824aa45fa9f205a6845f485f0746c7b.poster.avif?t=1688876621\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2062910/extras/4824aa45fa9f205a6845f485f0746c7b.webm?t=1688876621\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2062910/extras/4824aa45fa9f205a6845f485f0746c7b.mp4?t=1688876621\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Dynamic maps</strong></h2>Maps are dynamic! Avoid traffic, falling rocks, chase minecarts for resources, get on top of trucks, move platforms and bridges!<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2062910/extras/4228d2d081efff8d1548f8f9123cca06.poster.avif?t=1688876621\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2062910/extras/4228d2d081efff8d1548f8f9123cca06.webm?t=1688876621\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.